# Branch, PR, and feature promotion

Production is `main`. Do not merge all of `Landing` into `main`. Cherry-pick
the slice onto a branch off `origin/main`, PR, merge.

New user-facing UI takes `isFeatureEnabled` from `lib/featureFlags.ts`. Follow
`docs/feature-promotion.md`. Do not change `ballo-ads-web-app` from this repo.
